 "verdicts": {
  "IETF draft draft-klrc-aiagent-auth says that when an agent acts for a user or system, that principal must delegate authority to the agent, and the user/system context is preserved as input to authorization decisions and recorded in audit trails; the draft builds on SPIFFE, WIMSE, OAuth and OpenID SSF, and allows agents to exchange credentials via OAuth 2.0 Token Exchange or Transaction Tokens.": 1
 }
